title: mf label begin
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Open a label inside the current context and print it, to export as METAFOLDER_LABEL

Opens a label named `NAME` (described by `DESCRIPTION`), inside the context `METAFOLDER_LABEL` passes on when there is one, and prints it as `<repo uuid>:<label id>` — what to export so every `mf` started meanwhile writes in it ([[Labels and contexts]]).
